  "notable_quotes": [
    "CH4 in RHO zeolite shows a nonmonotonic Type 6 trend: Ds drops from 6.5×10−10 to 0.9×10−10 m2/s from 1 to 9 molecules/cage, then rises to 4.4×10−10 at 12.",
    "Diffusion radius R tracks Ds: in RHO it falls from 152 to 60 Å then rises to 141 Å, while in LTA it rises to 369 Å then falls to 241 Å and remains larger.",
    "CH4 diffusion in cage-type zeolites proceeds by jump-like intracage motion plus intercage jumps, and loading dependence is governed mainly by jump frequency between cages."
  ],
